 begin="02:53.405" end="02:53.711">arata</span><span begin="02:53.711" end="02:54.016">nata</span><span begin="02:54.016" end="02:54.322">bino</span><span begin="02:54.322" end="02:54.628">haji</span><span begin="02:54.628" end="02:54.789">ma</span><span begin="02:54.789" end="02:55.033"></span><span begin="02:55.033" end="02:55.239">ri</span><span begin="02:55.239" end="02:55.545">wa</span></text><text for="L62"><span begin="02:55.545" end="02:55.908">kimi</span><span begin="02:55.908" end="02:56.179">gama</span><span begin="02:56.179" end="02:56.578">mori</span><span begin="02:56.578" end="02:56.918">nui</span><span begin="02:56.918" end="02:57.247">tako</span><span begin="02:57.247" end="02:57.648">no</span><span begin="02:57.648" end="02:58.269">chini</span></text><text for="L63"><span begin="02:58.555" end="02:58.938">me</span><span begin="02:58.938" end="02:59.411">bui</span><span begin="02:59.411" end="02:59.833">tai</span><span begin="02:59.833" end="03:00.574">no</span><span begin="03:00.574" end="03:01.184">chito</span><span begin="03:01.473" end="03:02.558">tomo</span><span begin="03:02.558" end="03:05.003">ni</span></text></transliteration></transliterations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="03:14.164"><div begin="00:00.373" end="03:05.003"><p begin="00:00.373" end="00:02.771" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:00.373" end="00:00.840">まる</span><span begin="00:00.840" end="00:00.985">で</span><span begin="00:01.082" end="00:01.565">御伽</span><span begin="00:01.565" end="00:01.733">の</span><span begin="00:01.733" end="00:02.771">話</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仿佛是童话故事</span></p><p begin="00:02.803" end="00:04.968" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:02.803" end="00:03.055">終</span><span begin="00:03.055" end="00:03.370">わり</span><span begin="00:03.370" end="00:03.992">迎え</span><span begin="00:03.992" end="00:04.535">た</span><span begin="00:04.535" end="00:04.968">証</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终于迎来结尾的证明</span></p><p begin="00:05.136" end="00:07.851" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:05.136" end="00:05.379">長</span><span begin="00:05.379" end="00:05.616">過</span><span begin="00:05.616" end="00:05.994">ぎる</span><span begin="00:05.994" end="00:06.962">旅路</span><span begin="00:06.962" end="00:07.202">か</span><span begin="00:07.202" end="00:07.851">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是从漫漫旅途中截取出的一个章节</span></p><p begin="00:07.901" end="00:09.589" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:07.901" end="00:08.301">切り</span><span begin="00:08.301" end="00:08.566">出し</span><span begin="00:08.566" end="00:08.896">た</span><span begin="00:08.896" end="00:09.589">一節</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">截取出的一节</span></p><p begin="00:09.633" end="00:11.905" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:09.633" end="00:09.958">それ</span><span begin="00:09.958" end="00:10.294">は</span><span begin="00:10.294" end="00:10.607">かつ</span><span begin="00:10.607" end="00:10.899">て</span><span begin="00:10.899" end="00:11.256">この</span><span begin="00:11.256" end="00:11.580">地</span><span begin="00:11.580" end="00:11.905">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是与勇者一同讨伐</span></p><p begin="00:11.945" end="00:14.111" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:11.945" end="00:12.306">影</span><span begin="00:12.306" end="00:12.600">を</span><span begin="00:12.600" end="00:12.904">落と</span><span begin="00:12.904" end="00:13.158">し</span><span begin="00:13.158" end="00:13.389">た</span><span begin="00:13.389" end="00:13.750">悪</span><span begin="00:13.750" end="00:14.111">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经笼罩此地的邪恶</span></p><p begin="00:14.245" end="00:16.735" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:14.245" end="00:14.653">討ち</span><span begin="00:14.653" end="00:14.974">取り</span><span begin="00:14.974" end="00:15.109">し</span><span begin="00:15.109" end="00:16.053">勇者</span><span begin="00:16.053" end="00:16.735">との</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样一段短暂旅途的记忆</span></p><p begin="00:16.901" end="00:18.828" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:16.901" end="00:17.495">短い</span><span begin="00:17.495" end="00:17.746">旅</span><span begin="00:17.746" end="00:18.053">の</span><span begin="00:18.053" end="00:18.828">記憶</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">短暂旅程的记忆</span></p><p begin="00:29.242" end="00:31.502" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:29.242" end="00:29.776">物</span><span begin="00:29.776" end="00:30.288">語</span><span begin="00:30.288" end="00:30.686">は</span><span begin="00:30.686" end="00:31.134">終わ</span><span begin="00:31.134" end="00:31.502">り</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">故事就此落幕</span></p><p begin="00:31.635" end="00:33.902" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:31.635" end="00:31.949">勇</span><span begin="00:31.949" end="00:32.284">者</span><span begin="00:32.284" end="00:32.561">は</span><span begin="00:32.561" end="00:33.120">眠り</span><span begin="00:33.120" end="00:33.408">に</span><span begin="00:33.408" end="00:33.902">つく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">勇者沉入长眠</span></p><p begin="00:34.003" end="00:36.582" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:34.003" end="00:34.290">穏</span><span begin="00:34.290" end="00:34.561">やか</span><span begin="00:34.561" end="00:34.818">な</span><span begin="00:34.818" end="00:35.955">日常</span><span begin="00:35.955" end="00:36.582">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯有平静的日常仍在世间延续</span></p><p begin="00:36.802" end="00:38.369" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:36.802" end="00:37.115">この</span><span begin="00:37.115" end="00:37.370">地</span><span begin="00:37.370" end="00:37.539">に</span><span begin="00:37.539" end="00:37.877">残</span><span begin="00:37.877" end="00:38.123">し</span><span begin="00:38.123" end="00:38.369">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">残留于此</span></p><p begin="00:38.502" end="00:40.742" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:38.502" end="00:38.822">時</span><span begin="00:38.822" end="00:39.012">の</span><span begin="00:39.012" end="00:39.326">流</span><span begin="00:39.326" end="00:39.570">れ</span><span begin="00:39.655" end="00:40.011">は</span><span begin="00:40.011" end="00:40.422">無情</span><span begin="00:40.422" end="00:40.742">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时光荏苒 岁月无情 催人忘却</span></p><p begin="00:40.825" end="00:43.089" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:40.825" end="00:41.198">人</span><span begin="00:41.198" end="00:41.478">を</span><span begin="00:41.478" end="00:42.290">忘れ</span><span begin="00:42.290" end="00:42.636">させ</span><span begin="00:42.636" end="00:43.089">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让人忘却一切</span></p><p begin="00:43.102" end="00:45.764" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:43.102" end="00:43.546">そこ</span><span begin="00:43.546" end="00:43.769">に</span><span begin="00:43.769" end="00:44.077">生き</span><span begin="00:44.077" end="00:44.327">た</span><span begin="00:44.327" end="00:44.988">軌跡</span><span begin="00:44.988" end="00:45.764">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经生活过的轨迹</span></p><p begin="00:46.111" end="00:47.641" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="00:46.111" end="00:46.426">錆</span><span begin="00:46.426" end="00:46.648">び</span><span begin="00:46.648" end="00:46.876">付</span><span begin="00:46.876" end="00:47.131">い</span><span begin="00:47.131" end="00:47.386">て</span><span begin="00:47.386" end="00:47.641">いく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也渐渐锈迹斑驳</span></p><p begin="00:47.641" end="00:49.235" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="00:47.641" end="00:48.023">それ</span><span begin="00:48.023" end="00:48.407">でも</span><span begin="00:48.407" end="00:48.837">君</span><span begin="00:48.837" end="00:49.235">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可即便如此 你的话语心愿和勇气</span></p><p begin="00:49.605" end="00:51.678" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="00:49.605" end="00:49.947">言</span><span begin="00:49.947" end="00:50.153">葉</span><span begin="00:50.153" end="00:50.497">も</span><span begin="00:50.497" end="00:50.790">願い</span><span begin="00:50.790" end="00:51.086">も</span><span begin="00:51.086" end="00:51.382">勇気</span><span begin="00:51.382" end="00:51.678">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的话语 你的愿望与勇气</span></p><p begin="00:51.835" end="00:54.902" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="00:51.835" end="00:52.218">今</span><span begin="00:52.218" end="00:52.405">も</span><span begin="00:52.405" end="00:52.885">確か</span><span begin="00:52.885" end="00:53.102">に</span><span begin="00:53.102" end="00:53.609">私</span><span begin="00:53.609" end="00:53.965">の</span><span begin="00:53.965" end="00:54.519">中</span><span begin="00:54.519" end="00:54.902">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">至今仍切切实实活在我心中</span></p><p begin="00:55.066" end="00:56.907" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="00:55.066" end="00:55.612">生</span><span begin="00:55.612" end="00:55.987">き</span><span begin="00:55.987" end="00:56.447">て</span><span begin="00:56.447" end="00:56.907">いる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">存活于我的心中</span></p><p begin="00:57.942" end="00:59.505" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="00:57.942" end="00:58.369">同じ</span><span begin="00:58.369" end="00:58.567">途</span><span begin="00:58.567" end="00:58.895">を</span><span begin="00:58.895" end="00:59.192">選</span><span begin="00:59.192" end="00:59.505">んだ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们本该只是</span></p><p begin="00:59.505" end="01:01.644" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="00:59.505" end="00:59.986">それ</span><span begin="00:59.986" end="01:00.218">だけ</span><span begin="01:00.218" end="01:00.383">だ</span><span begin="01:00.383" end="01:00.726">った</span><span begin="01:00.726" end="01:01.108">はず</span><span begin="01:01.108" end="01:01.644">なのに</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">偶然选择了同路而行</span></p><p begin="01:01.644" end="01:03.124" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:01.644" end="01:01.855">いつ</span><span begin="01:01.855" end="01:02.067">の</span><span begin="01:02.067" end="01:02.278">間</span><span begin="01:02.278" end="01:02.490">に</span><span begin="01:02.490" end="01:02.701">か</span><span begin="01:02.701" end="01:02.913">どう</span><span begin="01:02.913" end="01:03.124">して</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然而为何泪水</span></p><p begin="01:03.160" end="01:07.722" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:03.160" end="01:03.667">頬</span><span begin="01:03.667" end="01:04.174">を</span><span begin="01:04.174" end="01:04.841">伝う</span><span begin="01:04.841" end="01:05.372">涙</span><span begin="01:05.372" end="01:05.943">の</span><span begin="01:05.943" end="01:06.542">理由</span><span begin="01:06.542" end="01:06.708">を</span><span begin="01:06.708" end="01:07.215">も</span><span begin="01:07.215" end="01:07.722">っと</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知不觉滑过脸颊</span></p><p begin="01:07.722" end="01:08.837" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:07.722" end="01:08.050">知り</span><span begin="01:08.050" end="01:08.280">たい</span><span begin="01:08.280" end="01:08.558">ん</span><span begin="01:08.558" end="01:08.837">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想知道那缘由 即便为时已晚</span></p><p begin="01:08.837" end="01:09.955" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:08.837" end="01:09.117">今</span><span begin="01:09.117" end="01:09.447">更</span><span begin="01:09.447" end="01:09.698">だ</span><span begin="01:09.698" end="01:09.955">って</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许我只需追溯那段曾一同走过的旅途</span></p><p begin="01:09.955" end="01:12.369" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:09.955" end="01:10.425">共に</span><span begin="01:10.425" end="01:10.734">歩ん</span><span begin="01:10.734" end="01:11.082">だ</span><span begin="01:11.082" end="01:11.396">旅路</span><span begin="01:11.396" end="01:11.679">を</span><span begin="01:11.679" end="01:12.024">辿れ</span><span begin="01:12.024" end="01:12.369">ば</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">重走过去一同走过的旅途</span></p><p begin="01:12.369" end="01:15.679" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="01:12.369" end="01:12.763">そ</span><span begin="01:12.763" end="01:13.040">こ</span><span begin="01:13.040" end="01:13.305">に</span><span begin="01:13.305" end="01:14.068">君は</span><span begin="01:14.068" end="01:14.438">居</span><span begin="01:14.438" end="01:14.852">なく</span><span begin="01:14.852" end="01:15.265">と</span><span begin="01:15.265" end="01:15.679">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕路上你已不在</span></p><p begin="01:15.779" end="01:17.668" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="01:15.779" end="01:16.187">き</span><span begin="01:16.187" end="01:16.405">っと</span><span begin="01:16.405" end="01:16.589">見</span><span begin="01:16.589" end="01:16.752">つ</span><span begin="01:16.752" end="01:16.935">け</span><span begin="01:16.935" end="01:17.398">られ</span><span begin="01:17.398" end="01:17.668">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也定能找到答案</span></p><p begin="01:26.952" end="01:29.334" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="01:26.952" end="01:27.456">物</span><span begin="01:27.456" end="01:28.015">語</span><span begin="01:28.015" end="01:28.498">は</span><span begin="01:28.498" end="01:28.964">続</span><span begin="01:28.964" end="01:29.334">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">故事仍在延续</span></p><p begin="01:29.334" end="01:31.510" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="01:29.334" end="01:29.874">一人</span><span begin="01:29.908" end="01:30.204">の</span><span begin="01:30.204" end="01:30.640">旅へ</span><span begin="01:30.640" end="01:31.018">と</span><span begin="01:31.018" end="01:31.510">発つ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我独自踏上旅途</span></p><p begin="01:31.610" end="01:33.356" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="01:31.610" end="01:31.952">立ち</span><span begin="01:31.952" end="01:32.246">寄る</span><span begin="01:32.246" end="01:32.515">街</span><span begin="01:32.515" end="01:32.774">で</span><span begin="01:32.774" end="01:33.065">出</span><span begin="01:33.065" end="01:33.356">会う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">途经城市中邂逅的人们</span></p><p begin="01:33.356" end="01:35.935" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="01:33.356" end="01:33.842">人の</span><span begin="01:33.842" end="01:34.093">記憶</span><span begin="01:34.093" end="01:34.461">の</span><span begin="01:34.461" end="01:34.748">中</span><span begin="01:34.748" end="01:34.980">に</span><span begin="01:34.980" end="01:35.461">残る</span><span begin="01:35.461" end="01:35.935">君は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">记忆里遗留的那个你</span></p><p begin="01:35.935" end="01:38.003" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="01:35.935" end="01:36.230">相</span><span begin="01:36.230" end="01:36.484">も</span><span begin="01:36.484" end="01:36.743">変わ</span><span begin="01:36.743" end="01:36.979">らず</span><span begin="01:37.026" end="01:37.412">お人</span><span begin="01:37.412" end="01:37.708">好し</span><span begin="01:37.708" end="01:38.003">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍是那副不变的老好人模样</span></p><p begin="01:38.102" end="01:40.326" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="01:38.102" end="01:38.547">格好</span><span begin="01:38.547" end="01:38.876">つ</span><span begin="01:38.876" end="01:39.112">け</span><span begin="01:39.112" end="01:39.397">て</span><span begin="01:39.397" end="01:39.881">ばかり</span><span begin="01:39.881" end="01:40.326">だね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总爱耍帅出风头</span></p><p begin="01:40.595" end="01:42.971" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="01:40.595" end="01:40.833">あ</span><span begin="01:40.833" end="01:41.105">ちら</span><span begin="01:41.105" end="01:41.308">こ</span><span begin="01:41.308" end="01:41.614">ちら</span><span begin="01:41.614" end="01:41.783">に</span><span begin="01:41.783" end="01:41.894">作</span><span begin="01:41.894" end="01:42.164">った</span><span begin="01:42.164" end="01:42.496">シン</span><span begin="01:42.496" end="01:42.733">ボル</span><span begin="01:42.733" end="01:42.971">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那于四处创造的象征</span></p><p begin="01:43.095" end="01:44.864" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="01:43.095" end="01:43.390">勝ち</span><span begin="01:43.390" end="01:43.673">取</span><span begin="01:43.673" end="01:43.842">った</span><span begin="01:43.842" end="01:44.274">平和</span><span begin="01:44.274" end="01:44.569">の</span><span begin="01:44.569" end="01:44.864">証</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">便是赢得和平的证明</span></p><p begin="01:44.864" end="01:45.635" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="01:44.864" end="01:45.180">それ</span><span begin="01:45.180" end="01:45.635">すら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不仅如此 那还是为了未来</span></p><p begin="01:45.735" end="01:46.819" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="01:45.735" end="01:46.057">未来</span><span begin="01:46.057" end="01:46.277">で</span><span begin="01:46.277" end="01:46.419">い</span><span begin="01:46.419" end="01:46.819">つか</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不会落得孤单一人</span></p><p begin="01:46.931" end="01:49.477" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40"><span begin="01:46.931" end="01:47.249">私</span><span begin="01:47.249" end="01:47.602">が</span><span begin="01:47.602" end="01:48.002">一人</span><span begin="01:48.002" end="01:48.204">に</span><span begin="01:48.204" end="01:48.569">なら</span><span begin="01:48.569" end="01:48.841">ない</span><span begin="01:48.841" end="01:49.159">よう</span><span begin="01:49.159" end="01:49.477">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不用再感到孤身一人</span></p><p begin="01:49.496" end="01:51.603" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41"><span begin="01:49.496" end="01:49.805">あの</span><span begin="01:49.805" end="01:50.023">旅</span><span begin="01:50.023" end="01:50.264">を</span><span begin="01:50.264" end="01:50.637">思い</span><span begin="01:50.637" end="01:50.813">出せ</span><span begin="01:50.813" end="01:51.076">る</span><span begin="01:51.076" end="01:51.340">よう</span><span begin="01:51.340" end="01:51.603">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能时刻回忆这段旅程</span></p><p begin="01:51.603" end="01:54.569" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42"><span begin="01:51.603" end="01:51.967">残</span><span begin="01:51.967" end="01:52.395">され</span><span begin="01:52.395" end="01:52.799">た</span><span begin="01:52.859" end="01:53.420">目</span><span begin="01:53.420" end="01:54.569">印</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而留下的记号</span></p><p begin="02:03.939" end="02:06.337" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43"><span begin="02:03.939" end="02:04.406">まる</span><span begin="02:04.406" end="02:04.551">で</span><span begin="02:04.648" end="02:05.131">御伽</span><span begin="02:05.131" end="02:05.299">の</span><span begin="02:05.299" end="02:06.337">話</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仿佛是童话故事</span></p><p begin="02:06.269" end="02:08.434" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44"><span begin="02:06.269" end="02:06.521">終</span><span begin="02:06.521" end="02:06.836">わり</span><span begin="02:06.836" end="02:07.458">迎え</span><span begin="02:07.458" end="02:08.001">た</span><span begin="02:08.001" end="02:08.434">証</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终于迎来结尾的证明</span></p><p begin="02:08.573" end="02:10.955" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45"><span begin="02:08.573" end="02:08.970">私</span><span begin="02:08.970" end="02:09.271">を</span><span begin="02:09.271" end="02:09.620">変え</span><span begin="02:09.620" end="02:10.012">た</span><span begin="02:10.012" end="02:10.558">出</span><span begin="02:10.558" end="02:10.955">会い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">改变了我一生的相遇</span></p><p begin="02:10.955" end="02:13.068" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46"><span begin="02:10.955" end="02:11.378">百分</span><span begin="02:11.378" end="02:11.800">の</span><span begin="02:11.800" end="02:12.151">一</span><span begin="02:12.151" end="02:12.463">の</span><span begin="02:12.463" end="02:13.068">旅路</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只占我生命百分之一的旅程</span></p><p begin="02:14.201" end="02:15.702" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47"><span begin="02:14.201" end="02:14.451">君</span><span begin="02:14.451" end="02:14.684">の</span><span begin="02:14.684" end="02:15.002">勇気</span><span begin="02:15.002" end="02:15.202">を</span><span begin="02:15.202" end="02:15.452">いつ</span><span begin="02:15.452" end="02:15.702">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕有一天时间的风带走你的勇气</span></p><p begin="02:15.702" end="02:16.837" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48"><span begin="02:15.702" end="02:15.968">風</span><span begin="02:15.968" end="02:16.270">が</span><span begin="02:16.270" end="02:16.553">さら</span><span begin="02:16.553" end="02:16.837">って</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">会带走你的勇气</span></p><p begin="02:16.873" end="02:19.299" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49"><span begin="02:16.873" end="02:17.267">誰</span><span begin="02:17.267" end="02:17.412">の</span><span begin="02:17.412" end="02:17.682">記憶</span><span begin="02:17.682" end="02:17.951">から</span><span begin="02:17.951" end="02:18.221">消え</span><span begin="02:18.221" end="02:18.490">て</span><span begin="02:18.490" end="02:18.760">しま</span><span begin="02:18.760" end="02:19.029">って</span><span begin="02:19.029" end="02:19.299">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从别人的记忆中消散而去</span></p><p begin="02:19.299" end="02:23.140" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50"><span begin="02:19.299" end="02:19.975">私</span><span begin="02:19.975" end="02:20.478">が</span><span begin="02:20.478" end="02:21.023">未来</span><span begin="02:21.023" end="02:21.220">に</span><span begin="02:21.220" end="02:21.700">連れ</span><span begin="02:21.700" end="02:22.180">て</span><span begin="02:22.180" end="02:22.660">行く</span><span begin="02:22.660" end="02:23.140">から</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也定会带着它走向未来</span></p><p begin="02:23.302" end="02:24.403" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51"><span begin="02:23.302" end="02:23.522">君</span><span begin="02:23.522" end="02:23.762">の</span><span begin="02:23.762" end="02:23.963">手を</span><span begin="02:23.963" end="02:24.110">取</span><span begin="02:24.110" end="02:24.403">った</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">坚定地牵起你的手</span></p><p begin="02:24.403" end="02:26.068" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52"><span begin="02:24.403" end="02:24.681">あの</span><span begin="02:24.681" end="02:24.882">日</span><span begin="02:24.882" end="02:25.236">全て</span><span begin="02:25.236" end="02:25.513">始</span><span begin="02:25.513" end="02:25.791">ま</span><span begin="02:25.791" end="02:26.068">った</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切自那日起始</span></p><p begin="02:26.161" end="02:27.238" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53"><span begin="02:26.161" end="02:26.396">く</span><span begin="02:26.396" end="02:26.621">だら</span><span begin="02:26.621" end="02:26.816">な</span><span begin="02:26.816" end="02:27.238">くて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管无波无澜</span></p><p begin="02:27.303" end="02:29.683" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54"><span begin="02:27.303" end="02:27.541">思</span><span begin="02:27.541" end="02:27.863">わず</span><span begin="02:27.863" end="02:28.017">ふ</span><span begin="02:28.017" end="02:28.280">っと</span><span begin="02:28.280" end="02:28.493">笑</span><span begin="02:28.493" end="02:28.731">って</span><span begin="02:28.731" end="02:28.969">しま</span><span begin="02:28.969" end="02:29.207">う</span><span begin="02:29.207" end="02:29.445">よう</span><span begin="02:29.445" end="02:29.683">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却每每回想都不禁露出笑容</span></p><p begin="02:29.683" end="02:34.315" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55"><span begin="02:29.683" end="02:30.040">あ</span><span begin="02:30.040" end="02:30.353">り</span><span begin="02:30.353" end="02:30.678">ふ</span><span begin="02:30.678" end="02:30.954">れ</span><span begin="02:30.954" end="02:31.311">た</span><span begin="02:31.311" end="02:32.063">時間</span><span begin="02:32.063" end="02:32.371">が</span><span begin="02:32.371" end="02:32.929">今も</span><span begin="02:32.929" end="02:33.453">眩</span><span begin="02:33.453" end="02:34.315">しい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那样平淡的时光如今却这般耀眼</span></p><p begin="02:34.315" end="02:35.433" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56"><span begin="02:34.315" end="02:34.644">知り</span><span begin="02:34.644" end="02:34.859">た</span><span begin="02:34.859" end="02:34.959">い</span><span begin="02:34.959" end="02:35.433">んだ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时至今日 我仍想探寻那答案</span></p><p begin="02:35.433" end="02:36.462" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57"><span begin="02:35.433" end="02:35.664">今</span><span begin="02:35.664" end="02:35.955">更</span><span begin="02:35.955" end="02:36.205">だ</span><span begin="02:36.205" end="02:36.462">って</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我知道无论何时只要回头</span></p><p begin="02:36.512" end="02:38.942" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58"><span begin="02:36.512" end="02:36.859">振り</span><span begin="02:36.859" end="02:37.097">返</span><span begin="02:37.097" end="02:37.436">る</span><span begin="02:37.436" end="02:37.553">と</span><span begin="02:37.553" end="02:37.901">そこ</span><span begin="02:37.901" end="02:38.248">には</span><span begin="02:38.248" end="02:38.595">いつ</span><span begin="02:38.595" end="02:38.942">でも</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为回望过去那里无时无刻</span></p><p begin="02:38.942" end="02:42.199" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L59"><span begin="02:38.942" end="02:39.485">優</span><span begin="02:39.485" end="02:40.028">しく</span><span begin="02:40.028" end="02:40.571">微</span><span begin="02:40.571" end="02:41.113">笑み</span><span begin="02:41.113" end="02:41.656">かけ</span><span begin="02:41.656" end="02:42.199">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总能看见温柔微笑的你</span></p><p begin="02:42.435" end="02:47.372" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L60"><span begin="02:42.435" end="02:42.971">君</span><span begin="02:42.971" end="02:43.347">が</span><span begin="02:43.347" end="02:43.900">いる</span><span begin="02:43.900" end="02:44.324">か</span><span begin="02:44.324" end="02:47.372">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">面带笑容的你啊</span></p><p begin="02:53.405" end="02:55.545" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L61"><span begin="02:53.405" end="02:53.711">新</span><span begin="02:53.711" end="02:54.016">たな</span><span begin="02:54.016" end="02:54.322">旅</span><span begin="02:54.322" end="02:54.628">の</span><span begin="02:54.628" end="02:54.789">始</span><span begin="02:54.789" end="02:55.033">ま</span><span begin="02:55.033" end="02:55.239">り</span><span begin="02:55.239" end="02:55.545">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这段崭新的旅途</span></p><p begin="02:55.545" end="02:58.269" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L62"><span begin="02:55.545" end="02:55.908">君</span><span begin="02:55.908" end="02:56.179">が</span><span begin="02:56.179" end="02:56.578">守り</span><span begin="02:56.578" end="02:56.918">抜い</span><span begin="02:56.918" end="02:57.247">た</span><span begin="02:57.247" end="02:57.648">この</span><span begin="02:57.648" end="02:58.269">地に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将始于你所守护的这片土地</span></p><p begin="02:58.555" end="03:05.003" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L63"><span begin="02:58.555" end="02:58.938">芽</span><span begin="02:58.938" end="02:59.411">吹い</span><span begin="02:59.411" end="02:59.833">た</span><span begin="02:59.833" end="03:00.574">命</span><span begin="03:00.574" end="03:01.184">と</span><span begin="03:01.473" end="03:02.558">共</span><span begin="03:02.558" end="03:05.003">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与萌芽的生命同行</span></p></div></body></tt>